# Only what this repository's own commands, and the editors and systems around them, leave behind. A broader
# rule once hid a source folder (#58); CI fails if anything under src, tests, tools or site is ignored.

# Every build, publish, package, icon download, MCP clone and test result (UseArtifactsOutput, the justfile, tools/,
# the tests' VSTestResultsDirectory).
/artifacts/

# Claude Code's local settings and its agents' worktrees.
/.claude/

# Local agent working notes; contributor guidance lives in CLAUDE.md.
/docs/agent/

# Editors
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
*.swp
*~

# Operating systems
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
[Dd]esktop.ini
